  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Wednesday 18 November 2026 at 9:30AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nPositioned in one of Orewa’s premier lifestyle pockets with a peaceful backdrop looking out to lush Eaves Bush, this perfectly designed, modern home delivers the ultimate combination of style, comfort, and functional versatility.\r\n\r\nConstructed with timeless weatherboard and brick, this property welcomes you with brilliant street appeal and a brilliantly configured layout. At its heart, the light-filled, open-plan living, dining, and kitchen area forms the ultimate family hub. The sleek, modern kitchen is a chef's dream complete with a central island and scullery, ensuring cooking and entertaining is effortless.\r\n\r\nIndoor-outdoor flow is seamless. Step right out from the main living spaces onto a sweeping wrap-around deck - the ideal private spot to host family and friends while soaking in the peaceful natural views out to Eaves Bush.\r\n\r\nAccommodation has been thoughtfully considered. Positioned at the front of the home, is one of the bedrooms offering exceptional flexibility, featuring its own kitchenette and ensuite - ideal for extended family, an independent teenager, or visiting guests. The primary and remaining double bedrooms are serviced by a clever 'Jack-and-Jil' bathroom, complemented by a separate guest toilet to easily handle day-to-day family living.\r\n\r\nComplete with an internal-access garage and easy-care landscaping, you'll have more time to enjoy the incredible lifestyle on offer. In zone for Nukumea Primary School and Orewa College, and just minutes from Orewa Beach, bustling local cafés, eateries, and shops, with convenient motorway access nearby.\r\n\r\nProperties offering this level of thoughtful design, bush-view serenity, in Orewa are tightly held and in high demand.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange a private viewing or see you at the next open home!",
